nThus we will produce a public message: I agree with B but we must consider C. Provide reasoning. Then metadata vote remains B (since we haven't changed). So vote B.\n\nNow format: PUBLIC_MESSAGE: ... METADATA_JSON: {\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}\n\nProceed."}
